== About Me
Hello! My name is Ryan Minghao Zhao, I recently recieved my B.A. in Economics and B.S. in Applied Mathematics from UC San Diego, I am currently a predoc at UCLA Anderson School of Management, my supervisor is Professor Ashvin Gandhi. 

I plan to pursue a Ph.D. in Economics specializing in Econometric theory and/or Health Economics, and
build a career involving rigorous academic research and
teaching in the near future.

Outside of research, I love exploring hiking trails and visiting national parks.

